+ * POST /api/v3/tags/delete-unused?workspaceId=… - delete every tag of the workspace that no response
+ * carries, answering how many were deleted.
+ *
+ * A POST custom method rather than a `DELETE` on the collection, for the same reason as
+ * `/api/v3/responses/batch-delete`: a distinct path cannot be reached by a collection delete that lost
+ * its filters. Session-only, like the other tag routes.
+ */
